{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Palms is a first-person psychological horror game that traps you at the end of a work day in your endlessly looping office. Carefully inspect your environment with each loop you enter: if you see something amiss, turn back the way you came, otherwise continue forward. To escape the office you must complete a series of sequential loops without missing any differences. <i>Are you sure you didn't miss anything?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/b920d47ffd9a167880bd179dc9c3468d.webp?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/2b368b01ef8ffff9ac5d5430d2581bbf.poster.avif?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/2b368b01ef8ffff9ac5d5430d2581bbf.webm?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/2b368b01ef8ffff9ac5d5430d2581bbf.mp4?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open drawers and use computers. There\u2019s more than just anomalies hidden in this office. Don't forget to check the window!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/16cc461a9054da5fdb0769253051a34c.webp?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/67f995026e5ca82b165e2cf3e45dd863.poster.avif?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/67f995026e5ca82b165e2cf3e45dd863.webm?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/67f995026e5ca82b165e2cf3e45dd863.mp4?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While snooping through the office, find: useful items, hints as to what's going on at Twin Palms and a few collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/18b513cc4edac25305a5e946316dc1a8.webp?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/693276787a82368f5f0179c486c1dabb.poster.avif?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/693276787a82368f5f0179c486c1dabb.webm?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/693276787a82368f5f0179c486c1dabb.mp4?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies are a bit more involved than <i>'just turn back.'</i> Trial Anomalies will occasionally shake up your endless trek over the same office carpet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/40fe21ba6b73cd3082bd0636f041194a.webp?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/9ec8e7e85176e4dd1eeccad7e08a0706.poster.avif?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/9ec8e7e85176e4dd1eeccad7e08a0706.webm?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/9ec8e7e85176e4dd1eeccad7e08a0706.mp4?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of your time will be spent overthinking your coworkers' desk decor \u2014 but sometimes, by luck or skill, you may find yourself somewhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/c30080bec22f2d3b70ee54c26c0e911a.webp?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/8a7f8ac79ea84c6c470d07881ce963f4.poster.avif?t=1755967121\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/8a7f8ac79ea84c6c470d07881ce963f4.webm?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765340/extras/8a7f8ac79ea84c6c470d07881ce963f4.mp4?t=1755967121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy hour isn'